  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A coin is biased so that the head is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> times as likely to occur as tail. This coin is tossed until a head or three tails occur. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;denotes the number of tosses of the coin, then the mean of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>38</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>81</mn><mn>64</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>It is given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Since coin is tossed till either&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mi>H</mi></math>&nbsp;or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;occurs. So, process will end in the maximum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;throws.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Now we know that,</p><p>Mean is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>21</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}